# The FreeFounders address the app opens: the gateway of `npm run dev` on this PC's network address, port 8080.
# Laptop hotspot: 192.168.137.1 · office Wi-Fi: e.g. 192.168.2.72 (ipconfig → IPv4 Address).
# Copy to .env to change it (restart `npm run mobile` after). Never commit .env.
# The address can also be changed on the phone: "Can't reach FreeFounders" → Change server address.
EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_URL=http://192.168.137.1:8080
